      "by": "Javier (\"Agibot and all the remaining makers with A and B\")",
      "rules": [
        "Batches of up to 10 new records, Agibot first.",
        "Non-generative mask cutouts are authorised (Javier, 27 Nov 2026): alpha only, the robot's pixels kept; no part recreated, no generative image.",
        "A bust, torso or arms-only product is shown as the maker presents it; no body is added. No model is assigned to a company record without one.",
        "For a family record (A2, X2) one included variant may illustrate it, named in the alt text and provenance."
      ]
    }
